From 374dba4a72327261816690800c3a2c6373896a57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rvvm-ios <rvvm-ios@local>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 05:08:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] net: tap_reinit for usermode & Linux TAP, error-code
 net_udp_send; fb: is_headless; bochs: snapshot suspend

- tap_reinit() drops connections & reinitializes backend (iOS network resume)
- Persist port-forwarding rules across tap reinit
- net_udp_send()/net_icmp_send() report error codes, hard errors close sockets
- ICMP socket mapping keeps the echo id as port
- rvvm_fbdev_is_headless() public query
- bochs-display: snapshot suspend/resume (VRAM + display regs)
- blk_io: stdio.h for SEEK_* on Darwin
- isolation: bypass when host filesystem sharing (virtio-fs) is active
---
